[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 979.749, "timestamp": "00:16:19", "text": "。  它叫什麼名字？  呃，幽靈聊天。  嘿。呃。哦，等等。我得再做一次。  嘿，夥計。  呃，稍等一下。讓我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 982.23, "timestamp": "00:16:22", "text": "下載一下。  所以，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 984.466, "timestamp": "00:16:24", "text": "現在可以在單一顯示器上閱讀聊天記錄了。所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 985.59, "timestamp": "00:16:25", "text": "（咳嗽並清了清喉嚨）"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 993.67, "timestamp": "00:16:33", "text": "哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 996.47, "timestamp": "00:16:36", "text": "我應該這樣做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1000.31, "timestamp": "00:16:40", "text": "什麼？我這就把這段複製下來，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1013.11, "timestamp": "00:16:53", "text": "什麼？我沒有抄襲你。哦，什麼？複製。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1016.389, "timestamp": "00:16:56", "text": "放在這裡。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1018.71, "timestamp": "00:16:58", "text": "嗯，是的。抱歉"}]